'''Dreaming of a Brighter Tomorrow''' (Korean: '''꿈꾸는 밝은 내일''' ''Kkumkkuneun Balgeun Nae-il'') is the ending theme for the 2017 Korean redubbing of ''[[M04|Celebi: Voice of the Forest]]''. It is performed by Lee Dawon. 

The song was uploaded to the composer's YouTube channel on March 27, 2024.

